description.narrative:
The Kristdemokratisk Internationellt Center (KIC) implements the contribution including two programs during the period 2019-2020: - Program for Young Politicians in Africa (PYPA) 2019-2020; KIC together with Centerns Internationella Stiftelse (CIS), Green Forum (GF) och Olof Palme Internationella Center (OPC) implements the program; - Strengthened Democracy program 2019-2020;
The program objective of PYPA is: “Young people active in political parties have increased their participation and influence within politics and work for democracy, gender equality, and human rights”. The PYPA objective will be achieved through: 1. Training courses during a period of 12 months in different topics: human rights, democracy, god governance, gender equality, sustainable development, and anti-corruption, political ideology, elections campaigns, communication and leadership. 2. Mini-projects to apply the new knowledge and skills acquired. 3. Competence development and dialogue with the leaders of the motherparties.
The objective of Strengthened democracy program is: "The Cooperation partner is a capabel democratic political party with high level of women participation, and the party uses innovative methods to finance its activities and it participates in regional cooperation fora for political parties." The objective will be achieved trough training of women politicians in leadershipskills and consolidation of the party through capacity building and participation in regional cooperation fora.
